{
  "_comment": "Cross-app contract for manual calendar events (ADR-027). server/test/calendar-schema-contract.test.js and test/calendar-schema-contract.test.ts both assert their models and constants against this file. Add a field or value on one side only and both suites fail; that is the point.",
